      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "液体中总是有许多晶核的，就在这些晶核周围形成小晶体."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "(1) 怎样用物质的分子结构学说来解释熔解和凝固",
        "现象？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "(2) 物质在什么条件下开始结晶？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "100. 熔解热"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由图229可以很直观地看出，在萘熔解的过程中其温度",
        "保持不变. 只有当萘全部熔解完毕，所熔成的液体的温度才",
        "开始上升. 可是在熔解进行的整个过程中，萘确实是不断从",
        "加热器中燃烧着的燃料处得到能量的. 那么这些能量都用到",
        "哪儿去了呢？因为根据能量守恒定律可知，它们是不可能消",
        "失的呀."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果你还记得在熔解的过程中必须破坏结晶结构，这个",
        "问题就可以得到解答了. 破坏结晶结构是需要能量的."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "可见，晶体在已被加热到熔点之后，所获得的能量，全部",
        "在它转化为液态的过程中用于改变它的内能了."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**在熔点时把1千克固态结晶*物质*变为*液体*所需的热量，",
        "叫做这种*物质*的熔解热.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "熔解热的量度单位是"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**焦耳/千克、千卡/千克和卡/克.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们用字母$\\lambda$$\\textcircled{1}$来表示熔解热."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": "footnote-1",
      "box": null,
